{"id": 35, "ts": 1783951487.0972075, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I appreciate the panel\u2019s focus on the missing stress\u2011resilience evidence for Candidate\u202fC. While C\u2019s technical awareness and leadership are impressive, we have no data showing that he can stay calm and make sound decisions under the high\u2011pressure conditions of long\u2011haul flights\u2014a non\u2011negotiable safety criterion. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB is explicitly noted to *handle stress very well* and is *very conscientious*, which directly addresses the stress\u2011resilience and reliability dimensions. His strong weather\u2011assessment ability and computer skills also support the technical competence needed for international routes. Although B is described as pretentious and sometimes adopts the wrong tone, these communication issues are less severe than the complete lack of stress\u2011resilience data for C and the egocentric communication deficits of A. Given that stress handling is the most critical safety factor and we have concrete evidence for B, I now recommend **Candidate\u202fB** for the long\u2011distance pilot position."}
